{
  "version": 1,
  "params": {
    "collection": {
      "label": "Collection",
      "type": "buttons",
      "options": [
        "Images from Metropolitan Museum of Art",
        "Files from the Biodiversity Heritage Library",
        "Images from the Library of Congress",
        "Images from the National Gallery of Art",
        "Images from the Rijksmuseum"
      ],
      "value": "Images from Metropolitan Museum of Art"
    },
    "month": {
      "label": "Data month",
      "type": "month"
    }
  },
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "# \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f One template, five institutions\n\nEvery card is driven by the **Collection** buttons. The stats are **exact** \u2014 precomputed monthly by [Commons Impact Metrics](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Commons_Impact_Metrics), not sampled or estimated.\n\n*Views* = pageviews of the wiki pages that **use** the collection's files. Switch the collection and watch every card re-aim; step the month to see history.",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "controls",
      "widgetType": "boardControls",
      "config": {
        "title": "Switch collection",
        "show": "collection,month",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "snapshot",
      "widgetType": "cimSnapshot",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{collection}}",
        "scope": "deep",
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trend",
      "widgetType": "cimTrend",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{collection}}",
        "scope": "deep",
        "wiki": "all-wikis",
        "months": 18,
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "topfiles",
      "widgetType": "cimTopFiles",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{collection}}",
        "scope": "deep",
        "wiki": "all-wikis",
        "topN": 10,
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "toppages",
      "widgetType": "cimTopPages",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{collection}}",
        "scope": "deep",
        "wiki": "all-wikis",
        "topN": 10,
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "topeditors",
      "widgetType": "cimTopEditors",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{collection}}",
        "scope": "deep",
        "editType": "all-edit-types",
        "topN": 10,
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sample",
      "widgetType": "categorySize",
      "config": {
        "category": "{{collection}}",
        "wiki": "commons.wikimedia",
        "sampleCount": 12,
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "leaderboard",
      "widgetType": "cimLeaderboard",
      "config": {
        "scope": "shallow",
        "wiki": "all-wikis",
        "month": "{{month}}",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    {
      "i": "note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 12,
      "h": 3,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "controls",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "snapshot",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "sample",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 7,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "trend",
      "x": 6,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 6,
      "h": 5,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "leaderboard",
      "x": 6,
      "y": 8,
      "w": 6,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "topfiles",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 13,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "toppages",
      "x": 4,
      "y": 13,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "topeditors",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 13,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 6,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    }
  ]
}
